<title>UK: Freddie Mac prices $500 mln 5-year bond, +52 b.p..</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac prices $500 mln 5-year bond, +52 b.p..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced overnight by joint lead managers Fuji International Finance, Merrill Lynch and Salomon Brothers, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOME LOAN MORTGAGE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     6.55 PCT  MATURITY   *13.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    13.NOV.96</p>
<p> REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD     +52 BP    LISTING     SING/LUX</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE  NOTES	*TWO-YEAR CALL OPTION</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
